```

**Safety flags:**
- `--dry-run` — preview mutation without applying. Returns what would change
- `--confirm` — required for destructive mutations (`delete`, `delete_resource`)
- Mutation arguments are schema-checked. Unknown named arguments and extra positional fragments are rejected with typed errors before any write runs.
- Without `--confirm`, destructive mutations are rejected with an error

**Format:** `--format json` (default) or `--format compact`

**Introspection:** Run `task-board q 'schema(mutation=NAME)'` for one mutation signature, or full `schema()` for the entire contract.

`task-board handoff` resolves the role's configured end status, verifies all
checklist items plus an actual stored task-scoped outcome, and serializes that
decision with the ordinary status transition. The underlying shared `handoff`
mutation carries the already-resolved role/status for remote execution; use the
CLI facade so callers do not have to reproduce role-policy resolution.

The `estimate` q field is a nested enum. Task/Bug values are either
`{"kind":"notEstimated"}` or
`{"kind":"estimated","scale":{"kind":"fibonacci","number":5}}`.
Story/Epic values are calculated, never persisted or hand-set. Full coverage
returns the same `estimated` shape with the descendant sum. Partial coverage
returns
`{"kind":"partiallyEstimated","rolledEstimate":{"kind":"estimated","scale":{"kind":"fibonacci","number":5}},"notEstimatedCount":"1/3","unestimatedTaskIds":["TASK-..."]}`.
Story counts direct Task/Bug children; Epic rolls up descendant Task/Bug values.
# Cross-story/epic ordering is derived from this task edge at read time.

# Track progress
task-board m 'set_estimate(TASK-260219-jkl012, estimate=estimated, scale=fibonacci, number=5)'
task-board m 'set_status(TASK-260219-jkl012, status=development)'
task-board m 'set_status(TASK-260219-jkl012, status=done)'
task-board m 'normalize_legacy_status(STORY-260713-72b914, expected_raw="in-progress", status=development)' # exact local legacy repair
task-board m 'rename(TASK-260219-jkl012, name=better-task-name)'  # change overview name/slug without changing ID
task-board m 'set_details(TASK-260219-jkl012, review=light)'       # required (default), light, or none

# Attach task-scoped artifacts
task-board m 'add_resource(TASK-260219-jkl012, name=TASK-260219-jkl012_design.md, content="...", type=precondition)'
task-board resource add TASK-260219-jkl012 ./TASK-260219-jkl012_results.md --type outcome
# Repair metadata for an existing .resources/TASK-.../orphan.md payload without rewriting its bytes
task-board resource adopt TASK-260219-jkl012 orphan.md --type outcome
task-board m 'update_resource(TASK-260219-jkl012, name=TASK-260219-jkl012_results.md, content="revised", type=outcome)'
task-board handoff TASK-260219-jkl012 --role developer  # verify checklist/outcome evidence, then enter the role end status
task-board m --confirm 'delete(TASK-260219-jkl012)'  # filesystem resources share one recoverable boundary

# Query the board
task-board q --format compact 'get(TASK-260219-jkl012) { status checklist outcomeResources }' # concrete worker
task-board q --format compact 'summary()'
task-board q --format compact 'summary() { observability-project }'
task-board q --format compact 'list(type=epic) { observability-epic }'
task-board q --format compact 'get(STORY-260219-def456) { observability-story }'
task-board q --format compact 'list(type=task, status=development) { observability-task }'
task-board q --format compact 'list(type=task, status=development) { id name status review estimate }'
task-board q --format compact 'get(STORY-260219-def456) { isBlocked isAdvisoryBlocked blockedBy derivedBlockedBy }'
task-board q --format compact 'agents()'

# Keep the parent/primary owner aligned in the unified goal ledger
task-board goal set-primary --objective "Keep the parent goal aligned with current user requirements." --reason "First actionable requirement"
task-board goal update --if-revision 1 --objective "Keep the parent goal aligned with current requirements and delivery work." --reason "Requirement expanded"
task-board goal get
task-board goal get --history
task-board goal get --goal-id PRIMARY-GOAL-260723-a1b2c3 --revision 1

